  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Client's actual manual work",
      "items": [
        "Bookkeeper opens individual shifts to compare actual time, extra-time notes, tasks and outcomes; invoices run Tuesdays.",
        "Payroll checks hours, kilometres and travel fortnightly. The transcript's payroll vendor wording is uncertain.",
        "Evidence: transcript 472\u2013486, 676\u2013702, 719\u2013726 and 1013. Rare export rounding is lower priority."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Keep native recording and financial authority",
      "items": [
        "Workers enter time/tasks/notes once in ShiftCare. OCD prepares an exception checklist, not an authoritative care or payroll record.",
        "Bookkeeper approves actual service/billing/pay treatment. Do not turn unclear transcript travel numbers into rules.",
        "Preserve the working ShiftCare \u2192 Excel/export \u2192 Xero flow. A native direct Xero connector is optional after the bookkeeper confirms fit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Read limitations and privacy",
      "items": [
        "REST review jobs require API access and verified resource contracts; bounded MCP can assist a supervised review now.",
        "Current MCP exposes timesheet/event/note reads, but note searches only reach notes created within 90 days.",
        "Missing pages, inaccessible/private notes and unknown fields are shown as gaps. No clean report is claimed from partial data.",
        "Assess native Care Signals for major-note alerts; reviewers verify flags and follow existing urgent care procedures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Exceptions and release gates",
      "items": [
        "No automatic invoice/payment or pay-run release. Xero and the confirmed payroll platform retain accounting authority.",
        "Unknown recipient/fund/rate/travel or locked records: bookkeeper resolves natively, then the case is refreshed.",
        "Export mismatch: check existing records before any re-export; never generate a duplicate invoice.",
        "Worker totals, if displayed, are provisional until payroll verification."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Design and layout evidence",
      "items": [
        "Proposed process: docs/OCD_ShiftCare_Integration_and_Automation_Design.md, sections 3\u20139. Node tags identify responsibility/stage.",
        "This fixed-position Archify process chart preserves the steps and relationships of the lane-based specification; that draft is retained alongside its diagnostics.",
        "Rendering checks do not prove live integration. Native feature access, every future REST operation and the production account still require validation."
      ]
    }
